        "Background": "Grant Zurkrieg grew up poor in Europe and has craved power ever since. A gift for economics made him a millionaire by his mid-twenties; when money wasn't enough, he built his body into a fighting machine, and that wasn't enough either. Now his Men in Black scour the world for its most powerful people, so that he can make them join him or crush them."
