        "Background": "Zurkrieg: Lines in Full\n-3 Fear (Drowning, from Childhood Accident)\n\nZurkrieg: Attacks\nExtending Cane: Zurkrieg's cane is engineered to extend, giving him command of any situation.\nThe World's Strongest: While fond enough of his cane, Zurkrieg enjoys finishing off opponents barehanded.\n\nZurkrieg: Character Hooks\nAnyone with remarkable skill or power can catch Zurkrieg's eye, and his lavishly funded experiments can cause trouble of their own — as in Ai's and Yuu's backgrounds."
